      "date": "2026-06-08T00:12:08.000Z",
      "title": "We Think You Can Look Beyond Munjal Showa's (NSE:MUNJALSHOW) Lackluster Earnings",
      "body": "Munjal Showa Limited's ( NSE:MUNJALSHOW ) earnings announcement last week didn't impress shareholders. While the...",
