      "title": "Munjal Showa Limited Recommends Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-2026",
      "body": "Munjal Showa Limited at its Board meeting held on May 29, 2026, considered and approved Recommendation of dividend subject to approval of members at 225% viz. INR 4.50 per fully paid up equity share of INR 2 each for the financial year 2025-2026. The dividend, if declared at the upcoming AGM to be held on August 24, 2026, will be paid within 30 days from the date of AGM.",
